<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Veba AG.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Veba AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier has issued five million American-style call warrants on Veba AG ordinary shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    90.0 DEM		  PREMIUM	10.67 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.65 DEM		  GEARING	13.42 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.NOV.96-14.MAY.98   PAYDATE	19.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSS, FFURT	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  87.20 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
